        [84642] = {"Rolling Thunder", "", "If you have an active Lightning Shield, your critical hits with Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning have a $h% chance to cause your Lightning Shield to gain an additional charges, up to 9. When you reach 9 charges, any attempt to gain another charge will instead launch a Lightning Shield ball at your target.\n\nWhen you have more than 3 Lightning Shield charges active, your Earth Shock spell will consume up to 1 surplus charge after 2 seconds, sending it at your target."},
