        [84701] = {"Demonic Empowerment", "", "Grants the Warlock's summoned demon Empowerment.\n        \nImp: Your Imp's Firebolts have a 100% chance to critically hit and cost no mana for $84693d.\n        \nVoidwalker: Summon demonic plating onto your Voidwalker, increasing its armor by $84694s1% and improving its threat generation by $84694s2%. Lasts $84694d.\n        \nSuccubus: Your Succubus casts Partial Invisibility, causing all melee and ranged attacks made against it to have a 75% chance to miss and increasing its damage by $84695s3%.\n        \nFelhunter: Sacrifice 10% to 20% of your maximum health to empower your Felhunter's Spell Lock ability, reducing its cooldown by $/1000;84696s1 seconds for $84696d. Must be above 20% health to cast.\n\nFelguard: Your Felguard hurls their weapon at the target and enrages, stunning the target for $84697d and increasing its damage dealt by $54508s1% for $54508d.\n\nInfernal: Your Infernal becomes immune to all attacks and spells for $84698d.\n\nDoomguard: Your Doomguard casts Shadow Bolt Volley, dealing $84699s1 Shadow damage to all nearby enemies within $84699a yards.\n\nEnslaved Demon: Apply Demonic Frenzy to your Enslaved Demon, causing it to take $84700s3 damage every $84700t3 seconds and increasing its attack speed by $84700s1% and casting speed by $84700s2% for $84700d.", "Empowered."},
